BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 505 Tm (?   Select a word, then delete it. The spacing closes up as it should.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 479 Tm (?   Press Save. What downloads is a real PDF with your edits in its text.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 442 Tm (Why it works this way) Tj ET
